                <pb facs="0788" n="638" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg638"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/62.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to the President of
                    Mexico.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-08-28"><hi rendition="#italic">August 28,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Having received your gratifying response to my inquiry, I have today addressed
                    identic telegrams to the five Central American presidents. I sincerely trust
                    that our concurrent appeal in behalf of peace may have good results.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
